Z||000000||BBBAD GT||05-19-2000||09:39 AM||||I've had several people email me asking for pics of my new wheels when I got them, I'm just now getting around to stealing my Bro-in-laws camera to take some shots.<P>Basically, they are 16x7" rims with Dunlop SP8000 205/55-16 in the front, and 225/50-16 in the back, mounted/balanced/shipped/lugs all for $750 (last set, sorry).  I really like them and the way they match the body paint (instead of the stock gray wheels matching the rocker panels).  Now, all I have to do is work on lowering the rear.....<P>  <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/tracer/Fiero-side1.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/tracer/Fieroside1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by BBBAD GT (edited 05-19-2000).]||||reg||6
